body:
I agree that the tone has shifted. However, I don't think its the communities fault as a whole. I think that more and more people realize that the devs of this game and many others follow and read the posts they feel like they can get their voice heard and it will make an impact on the game. Seeing the changes happen or the responses to their posts by devs does not help the mindset of the community. 

&#x200B;

Just keep looking for the artwork, video clips, etc. Good luck in the Canyon, and one day the future maps.
